# The apps/api and apps/worker Dockerfiles build from a clean context; anything listed here
# is never sent to the daemon and can never leak into an image layer.

.git
.claude
.turbo

**/node_modules
**/dist

**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
e2e/blob-report

docs

# Secrets and local environment files must never enter an image
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
